<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine Q1 agricultural growth at 4.22 pct.</title>
<headline>Philippine Q1 agricultural growth at 4.22 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine agriculture posted real growth of 4.22 percent in the first quarter compared with 2.49 percent a year earlier, the Bureau of Agricultural Statistics said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The government said details of growth in the farm sector would be announced later.</p>
<p>--MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8936, FAX 817-6267</p>
</text>
